# Title: Disable Macro Runtime Scan Scope
# ID: ab871450-37dc-4a3a-997f-6662aa8ae0f1
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-25
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment
# Description: Detects tampering with the MacroRuntimeScanScope registry key to disable runtime scanning of enabled macros
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((registry_key_name="*\\SOFTWARE\\*" AND registry_key_name="*\\Microsoft\\Office\\*" AND registry_key_name="*\\Common\\Security*") AND registry_key_name="*\\MacroRuntimeScanScope" AND Details="DWORD (0x00000000)")
